WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Myers,
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:02.936 line:92%
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:06.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's -- Get to the news.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:10.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look, I'm reacting
to the fact...

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:14.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of people are mad...
-Yeah?

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:15.582
-...that I say, "How's everybody
doing tonight,"

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:19.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then I don't wait
long enough for an answer.

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now, I'm in my head
about it.

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Stop reading that.
-What?

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:26.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Stop reading that stuff.
-The comments?

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:26.626 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:30.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have to read the comments
for Corrections.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you don't know
what Corrections are,

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:37.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
it is an extra thing we do
not on the show.

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:38.738 line:92%
It's available on YouTube.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:43.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I don't need you
telling me...

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:46.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Biden misspoke
earlier this week

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:50.150
during his visit to Michigan
and referred to his father

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
who was a salesperson,
as a coal miner.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:55.588
I'm sorry, but how the hel
do you mix those two up?

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:58.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's like saying,
"And my mom was a homemaker --

00:00:58.691 --> 00:00:59.926 size:78% position:39% line:92%
oh, wait, astronaut."

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:03.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
The White House said yesterday
that President Biden spoke

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:05.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
to Israeli Prime Minister
Benjamin Netanyahu

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:07.067 line:92%
and told him that the U.S.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
"expected a significant
deescalation

00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:12.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a path to a cease fire
with Hamas."

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:14.140 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
A path?

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.308 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
To a cease fire?

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.209 size:81% position:41% line:92%
You don't need a path.

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:19.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
Everything you have to do
is in the name.

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:20.647 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Cease fire."

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:21.748 size:78% position:39% line:92%
What else did he say?

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:22.849 line:92%
"Let's end this thing, BB.

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:25.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, I'm gonna count
to a million."

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:27.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
While discussing the ongoing
criminal investigation

00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:30.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
into the Trump organizatio
and in a new interview,

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:33.393
Former President Trump's
ex-personal lawyer Michael Cohen

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:36.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
