00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:41.601 line:92%
Said Trump, "Alleged children.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.670 line:92%
Microsoft co-founder Bill Gate

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:46.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
made his first
public appearance yesterda

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:47.474 line:92%
since his divorce announcement

00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:49.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I don't want to assume
